#: ../qml/pages/MainPage.qml:133
msgid ""
"Please note: Wegwijs can only retrieve traffic information for the "
"Netherlands. However, it does provide support for fuel prices and charging "
"stations in other European countries."
msgstr ""
"Harap diperhatikan: Wegwijs hanya dapat mengambil informasi lalu lintas "
"untuk Belanda. Namun, Wegwijs tetap mendukung informasi harga bahan bakar "
"dan stasiun pengisian daya di negara-negara Eropa lainnya."

#: ../qml/pages/MainPage.qml:133
msgid ""
"With Wegwijs, you're always informed about the current traffic conditions "
"and can easily find nearby fuel prices"
msgstr ""
"Dengan Wegwijs, Anda selalu mendapatkan informasi tentang kondisi lalu "
"lintas terkini dan dapat dengan mudah menemukan harga bahan bakar di sekitar "
"Anda"

